# NOTE: the generic template's 'lib/', 'lib64/' and '*.so' rules were removed
# on 2026-08-31. They matched nothing in the working tree, git history or the
# tracked file list, venvs live outside the repository by policy, and '*.so'
# would silently hide a compiled extension or a TensorRT plugin.

